{
  "Npcs.Basilisk.Desc.Avoiding": "You are fighting a basilisk! From what you can tell while not looking directly at it, the basilisk is a male [if (nofur) {scaled humanoid|reptilian biped}] standing a bit over 6' tall. He has a thin but ropy build, his tightly muscled yellow [if (nofur) {abdomen|underbelly}] the only part of his frame not covered in those deceptive, camouflaging gray-green scales. A long, whip-like tail flits restlessly through the dirt behind his skinny legs, and sharp sickle-shaped index claws decorate each hand and foot. You don't dare to look at his face, but you have the impression of [if (nofur) {a human face with a cruel jaw|a cruel jaw, a blunt lizard snout}] and a crown of dull spines."
  "Npcs.Basilisk.Desc.Safe": "You are fighting a basilisk! The basilisk is a male [if (nofur) {scaled humanoid|reptilian biped}] standing a bit over 6' tall. He has a thin but ropy build, his tightly muscled yellow [if (nofur) {abdomen|underbelly}] the only part of his frame not covered in those deceptive, camouflaging gray-green scales. A long, whip-like tail flits restlessly through the dirt behind his skinny legs, and sharp sickle-shaped index claws decorate each hand and foot. His [if (nofur) {face is human, with a cruel jaw|face has a cruel jaw, a blunt lizard snout}] and a crown of dull spines."
  "Npcs.Basilisk.Name": "Basilisk"
}
